//! Data-driven configuration and channel editors.
//!
//! Rather than hand-writing a message variant per protobuf field, each
//! config section is described by a [`SectionSpec`]: a list of [`Field`]s
//! with a key, label, help text and a [`FieldKind`]. Reading and writing the
//! underlying protobuf is generated by a small macro, so adding a field is a
//! one-line change and the UI renders every section with the same widgets.

